## Test that llvm-bolt can produce an identity rewrite of a PE/COFF binary.
## The output must be byte-identical to the input when no profile or
## optimization flags are given.

# RUN: yaml2obj %p/Inputs/two-funcs.yaml -o %t.exe
# RUN: llvm-bolt %t.exe -o %t.out.exe 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: BOLT-INFO: processing PE/COFF binary
# CHECK: BOLT-INFO: parsed 2 .pdata entries
# CHECK: BOLT-INFO: 2 functions discovered from .pdata
# CHECK: BOLT-INFO: disassembled 2 functions
# CHECK: BOLT-INFO: no profile data, producing identity copy
